Package: livegrab
Version: 0.1.0
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, ffmpeg, yt-dlp
Maintainer: Livegrab Maintainers <livegrab@localhost>
Description: Record a livestream URL with yt-dlp
 Livegrab serves a page on 127.0.0.1 and records a livestream with yt-dlp.
 The ffmpeg and yt-dlp packages are installed together with this package.
